@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
state Running {
  [*] --> Follower : recover and replay
  state Follower
  Follower : RequestVote [eligible, up-to-date]
  Follower : / persist vote before reply [R1]
  state Candidate
  Candidate : election timeout
  Candidate : / persist next term and self-vote [R1]
  state Leader
  Leader : client command / persist and replicate
  Leader : majority match [current-term entry]
  Leader : / persist commit, apply in order [R4-R7]
  Follower --> Candidate : election timeout\n/ persist term+1, self-vote
  Candidate --> Leader : distinct majority\n[same term]\n/ append no-op
  Candidate --> Follower : leader contact\n[term >= current]
  Leader --> Follower : higher-term RPC/reply\n/ persist term, clear vote
}
[*] --> Running
Running --> Fenced : storage failure / suppress effects [R7]
Fenced --> [*] : terminate; explicit restart required
note bottom of Running
[R2] Any role persists a higher observed term.
Stale messages cannot resurrect leadership.
Old-term traffic does not reset election timers.
end note
@enduml
